    <string name="disclaimer_title">Hello</string>
    <string name="disclaimer_body">RadarTren shows you where Renfe trains are and whether they are late, almost as it happens.\n\nThe data comes from Renfe, but this app is not Renfe\'s. Sometimes it may be wrong or late.\n\nIt is not an emergency service. If there is danger, call 112.</string>

    <string name="warning_offline">No connection to Renfe. You may be seeing trains where they were a while ago.</string>
